</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2004/11/17 (水) 00:26:22 <strong>▽</strong> 運営委員 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200411173002622_log_sirokuro.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200411173002622"></font>
